                    </svg>\\n                        </button>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n            \\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"bg-neutral-50 p-8 lg:p-16 relative z-10\\\">\\n            \\n            <div class=\\\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-12 mb-20\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"mt-4\\\">\\n                    <button class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#2a2a2a] text-white pl-1 pr-6 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium hover:bg-black transition\\\">\\n                        <span class=\\\"bg-[#3a3a3a] p-2 rounded-full\\\">\\n                            <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" class=\\\"size-3\\\">\\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" d=\\\"M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\\\" />\\n                            </svg>\\n                        </span>\\n                        More About Me\\n                    </button>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div class=\\\"max-w-xl text-right lg:text-right text-gray-800 relative\\\">\\n                    <div class=\\\"absolute -top-6 right-1/2 text-2xl\\\">✦</div>\\n                    <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium leading-tight\\\">\\n                        Hey👋, I'm a digital designer in los angeles, bringing digital experiences to life with striking visuals, expressive motion, and effortless interaction.\\n                    </h2>\\n                    <div class=\\\"absolute -bottom-8 right-10 text-xl\\\">✦</div>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n                    <span class=\\\"text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900\\\">21+</span>\\n                    <h3 class=\\\"font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2\\\">Website launched</h3>\\n                    <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Helping brands elevate their online presence confidently.</p>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n                    <span class=\\\"text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900\\\">2M+</span>\\n                    <h3 class=\\\"font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2\\\">Users engaged</h3>\\n                    <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Our designs connect and inspire millions worldwide.</p>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n                    <span class=\\\"text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900\\\">99%</span>\\n                    <h3 class=\\\"font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2\\\">Client satisfaction rate</h3>\\n                    <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\\\">We build relationships that thrive on trust and creativity.</p>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n                    <span class=\\\"text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900\\\">12+</span>\\n                    <h3 class=\\\"font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2\\\">Years of experience</h3>\\n                    <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Decades of crafting innovative solutions for leading brands.</p>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n        </section>\\n    </main>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\" }} />\n  );\n}\n",
